# Core

- Legacy backup is read-only; never modify `Old Verison WebSite/backup`
- Prefer `docs/audit/` and `docs/knowledge/` over rescanning legacy
- Classify facts: CONFIRMED / INFERRED / UNKNOWN / NOT FOUND
- No fabricated product, pricing, or marketing claims
- Minimize scope and dependencies
- Stop at approval gates defined in AGENTS.md
